Content & SEO Guidelines

- Listing Template:
  Name, Location, Description, Contact Info, Gallery

- Meta Titles Example:
  Accommodation in Limasawa | Direct Contact

- Meta Description Example:
  Find your stay in Limasawa with direct host contact. Resorts, homestays, and vacation rentals.

- SEO Keywords:
  Limasawa Accommodation, Scooter Rental Limasawa, Tours in Limasawa

- CTA Buttons:
  Call Host, WhatsApp Host, View Listing
